===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# A [[fermented]] [[alcoholic]] [[beverage]] made from [[pear]]s; somewhat analogous to [[cider]].
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1853|title=The Edinburgh Medical and Surgical Journal
|passage=M. Vasse never observed a fatal termination unless in two instances ; in which the persons, adults, had drank '''perry''' in large quantity.}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1892|author=James Mew; John Ashton|title=Drinks of the World
|passage='''Perry''' is less popular than cider, but some consider it superior.}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=2017|author=Andi Watson|title=Glister
|passage=Sip the '''perry''' of the Black Worchester and you will belch clouds of soot.}}

